# The cat062full module: the values of ASTERIX Category 062 (SDPS Track Messages), edition 1.21,
# as the category holds them. Used by the pack `asterix-cat062-full`. Generated by
# tools/gen/asterix2pack.py; do not edit by hand. A key is named after its item
# and subitems; a repetitive item is a list and its keys are the keys of one
# repetition.
